  "runtimeContract": [
    "A0JA Ahea has 28 mana, 14 seconds cooldown, 600 range. Native direct heal amount is absent. SPELL_EFFECT summons a registered e008 at caster position, requests stop and adds A0J8/A0J9 for 6 seconds, irrespective of targeted unit position. No healon/autocast script call was found; combat auto field is _.",
    "A0JA outgoing positive enemy damage branch creates a 0.9-second fixed-target-location timer and a distinct 8-second boolean cooldown; does not require weapon damage or A0JB. Damage branch follows Huskar unyielding/berserk and is independent of the earlier elemental/DemonStatue chain.",
    "Starfire timer retains source handle, creates summoned e008 with owner/userData/groups at stored point, adds A0JC and requests stomp. Dead source does not cancel the callback; explicit removed handle is unresolved.",
